# Security Architecture

The trusted runtime is intentionally small.

```text
                  HDEX Q1 Runtime
                         │
      ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
      │                  │                  │
 Policy Engine     Secure Sandbox     Audit Layer
      │                  │                  │
      └──────────────────┼──────────────────┘
                         │
                Worker Execution
```

The trusted runtime controls policy enforcement, sandbox creation, deterministic execution, auditing, and artifact verification.

---

# Trust Boundaries

Every component is assigned an explicit trust level.

| Component         | Trust Level                   |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Runtime Core      | Trusted                       |
| Policy Engine     | Trusted                       |
| Secure Sandbox    | Trusted                       |
| Audit System      | Trusted                       |
| Submitted Jobs    | Untrusted                     |
| Workers           | Semi-trusted                  |
| Worker Inputs     | Untrusted                     |
| Worker Outputs    | Untrusted until verified      |
| Local API Clients | Untrusted until authenticated |
| Artifacts         | Untrusted until verified      |

Trust is earned through verification—not assumed.

